  <page>
    <title>G force</title>
    <id>179795</id>
    <revision>
      <id>41676450</id>
      <timestamp>2006-03-01T00:16:56Z</timestamp>
      <contributor>
        <username>Paulraine</username>
        <id>274262</id>
      </contributor>
      <text xml:space="preserve">----
In [[physics]], the term '''g force''' or ''[[gee force]]'' refers to the symbol '''[[gee|g]]''', the force of acceleration due to [[gravity]] at the earth's surface.  

Similar names have been used for a number of commercial products, including:
G Force clothing and footwar established  1979  producing clothing in Nottingham England. The G Focre retail shop was opened in the original Boots premises 6 goose gate Nottingham. the interior was designed by John Eager.
*[[G Force (Dyson)|G Force vacuum cleaner]], made by Dyson
*[[G Force (anime)|G Force series]] of Japanese [[anime]] video entertainment programs
*G-force Karts is a [[go-kart]] racing facility in [[Richmond, Virginia]]
*G-Force music visualization software plug-in for [[media player]]s by SoundSpectrum, Inc.
*G-Force [[paintball]] game products made by G-Force Technologies  
*G-Force racing gear such as helmets, suits, and safety gear.  
*G-Force studio [[sound effects]] device by T.C. Electronic of [[Risskov]], [[Denmark]]
*[[GeForce]] [[Personal computer|PC]] [[graphics card]] made by [[NVidia]]
*GForce Virtual Instruments are software implementations of classic keyboard [[music synthesizer]]s by GMedia Music
*Gforce is a wedding music band serving the New York metropolitan area

{{disambig}}</text>
    </revision>
