      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Teresa''' is the name of several [[Portugal|Portuguese]] nobles connected with the royal family:

* [[Theresa, Countess of Portugal|Teresa, Countess of Portugal]] a.k.a. Teresa of León ([[1080]]-[[1130]]) wife of [[Henry of Burgundy]] and mother of [[Afonso Henriques]], first [[List of Portuguese monarchs|King of Portugal]]
* [[Teresa of Portugal (1157-1218)|Teresa, princess of Portugal]] ([[1157]]-[[1218]]) daughter of [[Afonso Henriques]] and wife of [[Philip of Alsace]], [[Count of Flanders]]
* [[Teresa of Portugal (1181-1250)|Teresa, princess of Portugal]] ([[1181]]-[[1250]]) daughter of [[Sancho I of Portugal]] and wife of [[Alfonso IX of Castile]].


{{disambig}}</text>
