      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Leg hair''' is hair that grows on the legs of humans, generally appearing at the onset of adulthood. 
Male legs are often hairier then females.
For a variety of reasons, people may [[leg shaving|shave their leg hair]].

==See also==
*[[hair]], [[facial hair]], [[beard]]

[[Category:Human appearance]]</text>
