      <text xml:space="preserve">{| class=&quot;toccolours&quot; border=&quot;1&quot; cellpadding=&quot;4&quot; style=&quot;float: right; margin: 0 0 1em 1em; width: 30%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 95%; clear: right&quot;
|- align=&quot;center&quot; bgcolor=&quot;#dddddd&quot;
|colspan=2| '''Los Angeles Sparks'''
