* [[Microsoft Office SharePoint Portal Server]]
* [[Mozilla Calendar]]
* [[GNOME|Gnome Desktop]] with [[Nautilus file manager]]
* [[OpenACS]]
* OpenLink [[Virtuoso Universal Server]] [http://www.openlinksw.com/virtuoso/]
* [[Open Source Applications Foundation]]'s [[Chandler (PIM)]]
* [[Plone]]
* [[Sakai, software project|Sakai]]
* SAP [[NetWeaver]] (Knowledge Management) (also RFC3253, RFC3648, RFC3744, RFC4316)
* [[skEdit]] (Code/text editor)
* [[Software AG]] [[Tamino]] XML Database
* [[Stellent Content Management]]
* [[Subversion (software)|Subversion]] (including versioning (checkout-merge-checkin)!)
* [[WebDrive]] [http://www.SouthRiverTech.com/] Virtual Drive Client maps a drive to a WebDAV Server

* [[WebCT]]
* [[Xythos]] WebFile Server development platform (server); Digital Locker and Enterprise Document Manager applications (server); Xythos Drive (desktop WebDAV client). See also RFC3253, RFC3744.
* [[Zope]]
* [http://www.neovalis.com/webdav.22.0.html Neovalis WebDAV Client Library for .Net] .Net-component for software developers
* [http://www.independentsoft.com/ WebDAV .NET]
* [http://www.independentsoft.com/ WebDAV .NET for Exchange]
* [http://www.independentsoft.com/ Independent DAV]
* [http://www.inforouter.com/webdav.asp infoRouter WebDAV Document Server]
* [http://talks.php.net/show/webdav/ PHP]

