      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Favila''' ('''Favilac''' or '''Fafila''') was king of [[Kingdom of Asturias|Asturias]] from [[737]] to [[739]]. He was supposedly killed by a [[bear]], but note that his father [[Pelayo]] was said to have, improbably, met the same fate.

