*[[Henriette Rothschild]] (1791-1866) married [[Moses Haim Montefiore|Sir Moses Montefiore]] (1784-1885)
*[[James Mayer Rothschild]] (1792-1868)
*[[Jean-Pierre de Rothschild]] (&quot;JP&quot;) (born 1960)
*[[Josef Rothschild]]
*[[Nica de Koenigswarter|Kathleen Annie Pannonica Rothschild]] (Baroness Nica de Koenigswarter) (1913-1990)
