*[[Simon de Rothschild]]   (1972-

'''By marriage:'''
*[[Elisabeth de Rothschild]] (1902-1945)
*[[Jeanne Stuart|Jeanne de Rothschild]] (1908-2003), actress
*[[Liliane de Rothschild]] (1916-2003) art collector
